	quest.08935F23101FE389.quest_desc: [
		"除了盔甲、配饰、附魔等，在 &6BigChadGuys Plus&r 中还有另一种提升属性的方法！部分收集里程碑可提供永久属性加成。以下是每个里程碑的具体内容："
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Mob Collection - Attack Damage\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"dark_red\",  \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"3731A9890D5811CC\" } }"
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Log Collection - Max Health\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"red\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"76AB52FE499A836F\" } }"
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Exploration - Movement Speed\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"yellow\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"0C16AD35A6E01EE7\" } }"
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Ore Collection - Armor Toughness\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"gold\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"46EDB9DC0F5AC44C\" } }"
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Fish Collection - Luck\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"green\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"673ABD4569E4C55E\" } }"
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Wildlife Collection - Attack Speed\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"55D01CEB1D098B67\" } }"
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Crop Collection - Armor\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"606B8E7912784AC4\" } }"
		""
		"完成一个收藏后，你就可以开始进阶&6精通&r，这是一种可无限重复的永久属性提升方法。"
		""
		"&9数字要变得更大。&r"
	]
